  "strings": [
    "Brave warriors drove many foul creatures from Minas Morgul.\u0000",
    "But the evil that taints this city cannot be fully cleansed.\u0000",
    "Even should the city be razed\u0000",
    "no man would dare dwell there so long as Sauron still lives.\u0000",
    "So our ordeal is not yet concluded.\u0000",
    "For to defeat Sauron utterly...\u0000",
    "the Ringbearer must first destroy the One Ring in the fires of Mount Doom.\u0000"
